BUGSQUATLIST:
-------------
Version 1.0	Release(No known Bugs)
-------------

Program Summery:
---------------

This program is a part of the SuperUtilities package. It allows anyone  
with the FORWARD_FLAG set to send carbon copies of a letter to other users.

The FORWARD_FLAG is the mail forward flag in the user privelege flags. 

If you like this program, and would like to continue to use it on 
C-Net Amiga version 2.0 you will have to register the file with me. There
is a one time registration fee of $10. This will register all of the 
SuperUtilities which will only be avaiable to to registered user when C-Net
release 2.0 comes out. People who allready registered SuperUtilities need
not register again.  


HOW TO INSTALL:

Change line # 48 of BBStext to read:

\h6ed.\#2pfiles:CarbonMail\\n1

and place the CarbonMail file in your PFiles directory.


Any problems, suggestions, or comments PLEASE let me know about them!

Ron
